msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:voiceTimeFrame, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/voiceTimeFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:voiceTimeFrameFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:voiceTimeFrame ."
msgstr "gmeow:voiceTimeFrameFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:voiceTimeFrame ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/voiceTuningFrameFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:voiceTuningFrame names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:voiceTuningFrame 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/voiceTuningFrameFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/voiceTuningFrameFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
